<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<ModMetaData>
  <name>武器基站：射击模式与装备属性</name>
  <author>WhiteGiverMa</author>
  <packageId>whitegiver.weaponstation.firemodes</packageId>
  <modVersion>1.0.0</modVersion>
  <supportedVersions><li>1.7</li></supportedVersions>
  <modDependencies>
    <li>
      <packageId>brrainz.harmony</packageId>
      <displayName>Harmony</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/2009463077</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>Vortex.WeaponStation</packageId>
      <displayName>Weapon Station</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/3807251471</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
    <li>
      <packageId>Aliza.VanillaFireModes</packageId>
      <displayName>Vanilla Fire Modes</displayName>
      <steamWorkshopUrl>steam://url/CommunityFilePage/3662471742</steamWorkshopUrl>
    </li>
  </modDependencies>
  <loadAfter>
    <li>brrainz.harmony</li>
    <li>Vortex.WeaponStation</li>
    <li>Aliza.VanillaFireModes</li>
  </loadAfter>
  <incompatibleWith><li>CETeam.CombatExtended</li></incompatibleWith>
  <description>为无人武器基站接通 Vanilla Fire Modes 的四种射击模式、按距离自动选择及每武器设置，并应用安装武器的装备时属性偏移量。有人武器支架继续沿用上游的操作员逻辑，不增加基站模式或改写其射击属性。仅适用于 RimWorld 1.7 原版战斗管线，不支持 Combat Extended。已有基站读档后直接生效，无需重建。</description>
</ModMetaData>
